### ledger health
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-ledger-health

### ledger liveness
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health/liveness

### ledger prometheus
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/prometheus

### ---- P01 dev-only lab (dev profile; run.sh sets it) ----
### money: 500 paise x 50 bps, HALF_EVEN -> 2
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/money?paise=500&bps=50
X-Request-Id: manual-p01-money

### ProblemDetail for a code
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/errors/VERSION_CONFLICT

### strict JSON: unknown field -> 400 UNKNOWN_FIELD
POST http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/strict-json
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"asha","amountPaise":12345,"admin":true}

### ETag
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/doc

### If-Match (428 without the header, 412 when stale)
PUT http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/doc
If-Match: "0"

### keyset page (then pass page.nextCursor as ?cursor=)
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p01/items?limit=50

### coded 404
GET http://localhost:8082/v1/__nope

### ---- P02 dev-only lab (dexter-lab, dev profile): real Postgres db `lab`, Kafka, Redis user `lab` ----
### status (starts the lab on first call)
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/status?init=true

### mint a token (persona asha|ravi|svc-reco; defect none|expired|not-yet-valid|lifetime-too-long|wrong-audience|
### wrong-issuer|wrong-typ|alg-none|hs256-confusion|unknown-kid|embedded-jwk|bad-signature)
POST http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/jwt/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"persona":"asha","defect":"none"}

### verify it (paste the token)
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/jwt/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### create a note (send twice with the same key: replay; change the body: 422; add ?holdMs=3000 and send twice: 409)
POST http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a3b-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"lunch","amountPaise":25000}

### cached read (X-Dexter-Cache: miss|hit|bypass)
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### outbox / projection / DLQ / cache state
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/outbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/projection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/dlq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8082/_dev/p02/cache
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
